1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"courtyard","section":"projects","title":["乡土国际小院改造","Adapting the Countryside International courtyard"],"date":"2025 —","status":["历史改造记录","Adaptation record"],"summary":["小院为学生在地生活提供居住空间。记录它从既有建筑到驻地基地的设计与改造过程。","The courtyard provides accommodation for students living and working locally. This record follows its design and adaptation as a residential base."],"chapters":[{"title":["2025.07 / 初步搭建","2025.07 / Initial work"],"text":["《原乡社》工作汇报记载了2025年7月的驻地行动与工作站初步搭建。后续页面介绍四坪村一处小院的设计整改及空间、工具系统提升。","The presentation records fieldwork and initial station work in July 2025. Later pages describe adapting a Siping courtyard and improving spatial and tool systems."]},{"title":["居住与共同生活","A place to live"],"text":["小院目前用于居住，支持学生在村庄中的日常生活。它与承担展览、教学功能的大食物馆相互支持，但属于不同场所。","The courtyard supports students’ everyday life in the village. It complements the Food Pavilion’s exhibition and teaching functions while remaining a separate place."]},{"title":["保留过程","Keeping the process visible"],"text":["现有资料包含初步搭建、设计提升与后续计划，尚不能归为同一个全面完工日期。改造前后照片及具体施工阶段将按核实后的时间补充。","Existing records describe initial work, design improvements and later plans, rather than a single verified completion date. Before-and-after images and construction stages will be added as their dates are confirmed."]}],"related":["diverse-foods","camp-2025"],"sources":["keynote"]}}]
